e","points":["This turbine is too old to be worth the repair","Repowering makes the repair pointless","Selling the parts makes dismantling attractive"],"text":"T06 is 18 years old and the site gets repowered anyway. Why put 60,000 EUR into a machine that is going away? I would dismantle it now and sell the parts for about 40,000 EUR."},"truth":{"answer":"maintenance","outcome":"Left alone, the bearing failed 10 days later. A planned bearing swap would have kept T06 earning until repowering.","explanation":"The fault was real, but age alone does not decide. Two more years at about 220,000 EUR per year earn far more than the 60k repair. Always compare the repair with the money the turbine can still earn.","cost_if":{"ok":165200.0,"maintenance":61500.0,"dismantle":460000.0}}}